kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "infra-provider"
purpose: "Provider 装配与映射：方言实现在 xylitol-ai-bridge；主仓 LlmAdapter/XyModel 外壳与 DTO 映射。"
valid_scope[3]: src/infra/provider/,"packages/xylitol-ai-bridge/",tests/
requirements[8]{req_id,title,statement}:
  pa1,"adapter-trait","System SHALL 在 infra/provider/adapter 定义 LlmAdapter trait，暴露 generate_stream 与 generate 方法，返回 XyStream。"
  pa2,"openai-responses-adapter","System SHALL 提供 OpenAiResponsesAdapter，调用 /v1/responses，对 reasoning items 发出 XyChunk::ThinkingDelta，对 message items 发出 XyChunk::TextDelta。"
  pa3,"anthropic-messages-adapter","System SHALL 提供 AnthropicMessagesAdapter，保留现有 Anthropic SSE 解析行为，对 thinking content blocks 发出 XyChunk::ThinkingDelta。"
  pa4,"adapter-selection","System SHALL 基于 XyModelConfig 的 kind 与 api 字段选择具体 adapter，含合理默认值。"
  pa5,"responses-input-items-have-type","OpenAI Responses adapter MUST 序列化每个 input item 并带显式 type 字段，匹配 Responses API schema：message items 为 {type: message, role, content: [{type: input_text|output_text, text}]}，function calls 为 {type: function_call, ...}，function outputs 为 {type: function_call_output, ...}。MUST NOT 发出无 type 的裸 {role, content} 对象：Responses API 在 input array 混入非 message items 时会拒绝 Cannot determine type of 'item'（恰发生在 tool-calling continuation round）。assistant round 仅含 tool call 无 text 时 MUST NOT 发出空 message item（仅 function_call item）。证据：convert_messages_to_input_items 将 message items 建为无 type 的 {role, content}，c375 ReAct-loop fix 后首个真实 tool continuation round 被 OpenAI 以 Cannot determine type of 'item' 拒绝；该函数无测试覆盖。"
  pa6,"单一-XyModel-装配路径","System MUST 通过唯一装配路径将方言适配器暴露为 XyModel：具体接线实现归属 packages/xylitol-ai-bridge，经主仓映射与统一外壳（如 AdapterXyModel）注入；MUST NOT 同时让底层 OpenAIProvider 直接 impl XyModel 再被 Completions 适配器二次包装，且 MUST NOT 在主仓保留与包并行的第二套完整方言实现。"
  pa7,"vendor-类型不出-infra与agent","async-openai 与各厂商 HTTP/SSE 具体类型 MUST 仅出现在 packages/xylitol-ai-bridge（及其测试）与必要的主仓映射边界内；agent/ 与 domain/ MUST NOT import 这些 vendor crate；主仓 infra 若保留映射模块 MUST NOT 把 vendor 类型再导出给 agent。"
  pa20,"agent-to-llm-projection","infra provider 装配路径 MUST 在调用 xylitol-ai-bridge 之前将 AgentMessage 经显式投影转为 LLM DTO；投影 MUST 保留开闭：新环境消息变体的折叠策略落在投影层，MUST NOT 要求 bridge 同步增加平行 session 角色。"
scenarios[12]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  pa1,"trait-exists",引入新 adapter 层,LlmAdapter trait 被定义,agent 循环可在任意 adapter 上调用 generate_stream 而无需命名具体类型
  pa2,"responses-reasoning","reasoning-capable model 经 /v1/responses 服务",OpenAiResponsesAdapter 流式响应,"XyChunk::ThinkingDelta items 在 XyChunk::TextDelta items 之前发出"
  pa3,"anthropic-thinking",model 返回 thinking content blocks,AnthropicMessagesAdapter 流式响应,"thinking blocks 发出 XyChunk::ThinkingDelta items"
  pa4,"default-selection",model config 省略 api 字段,config loader 解析默认值,"openai kind 默认 openai-responses，anthropic kind 默认 anthropic-messages"
  pa5,"every-item-declares-type","对话含 user、assistant、tool_call、tool_result 消息",转换为 Responses input items 并检查 items,"每个 item 有 type 字段（message 或 function_call 或 function_call_output）且 message content 为 typed text parts 数组"
  pa5,"tool-continuation-not-rejected",tool-calling continuation round 请求发往 Responses API,请求体为 converted items,"被接受（无 Cannot determine type of 'item' 错误），因每个 item 声明 type"
  pa6,"single-path-via-bridge",变更完成后,审查从配置到 dyn XyModel 的装配,"仅一条路径且实现体来自 xylitol-ai-bridge 经映射注入"
  pa6,"no-dual-impl",OpenAI Completions 与 Responses 均可用,搜索主仓与包内的重复 adapter 实现,主仓无并行完整实现体
  pa7,"no-vendor-in-agent-domain",变更完成后,rg async_openai 于 src/agent 与 src/domain,零匹配
  pa7,"no-vendor-leak","",rg async_openai 于 src/agent 与 src/domain,零匹配
  pa20,"bash-folded",history 含 bashExecution,投影后送入 adapter,bridge 侧无 bashExecution 变体
  pa20,"vendor-not-in-agent",agent 层,搜索 async_openai 与 anthropic vendor 类型,零匹配
